This repository contains code ported from PrimeNumberTheoremAnd
(https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd, commit a4fb698, Apache License 2.0):
  - lean/Palprimes/Sieve/Vendor/Mertens.lean   (from IEANTN/Mertens.lean and EulerMascheroniBounds.lean)
  - lean/Palprimes/Sieve/Vendor/Selberg.lean   (from Mathlib/NumberTheory/Sieve/{AuxResults,Basic,Selberg}.lean,
                                                original author Arend Mellendijk)
The ported files were adapted to Lean/Mathlib v4.37.0-rc1 and pruned to the results used here.

The Lean code depends on Mathlib (https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4, Apache License 2.0).
